  meth_title: "What the checks found",
  meth_intro: "I ran eight groups of statistical checks on the official polling-station data, using code anyone can inspect. Taken together, they do not establish manipulation. The details below explain the findings and what the checks can miss.",
  m1_t: "Votes at unusually high turnout (Shpilkin method)",
  m1_b: "The high-turnout area contains at most 1% of YES votes and 0.45% of NO votes. Leaving it out would change any result by at most 0.15 percentage points. These are not automatically fraudulent votes.",
  m2_t: "Does high turnout come with unusually high YES support?",
