  m1_c4: "RTV fee: 4,135 YES votes (0.95%) — YES share 51.60% → 51.48%.",
  m1_c5: "Turnout patterns of all four referendums overlaid: same precincts, same electorate. The comparison boundary (70.1%) is read off the other three referendums — they provide the comparison.",
  m1_a1: "Turnout distribution and leader votes by turnout, parliamentary investigations referendum: small red tail beyond 70%",
  m1_a2: "Turnout distribution and leader votes by turnout, social assistance referendum: small red tail beyond 70%",
